{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "0bf9674e12d0ed72fae351c5261b67de8f9f9ac64a417eeac6babe261c50be82", "ja": "私たちは、アイドル！", "zh": "我们是，偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b0f8cd4364b9fa6ea511396e08bcf3ca6d32953d0703a36c0bd3be85ab3a5c0e", "ja": "『はるみら』公演当日、本番前の様子を動画\nに撮る春香と未来。みんながいる公演では\nないのにお客さんがいっぱいだと驚く未来。\nプロデューサーは、今度はアイドルとしての\n魅力で、ファンの心を掴もうと激励する。", "zh": "“春未来”演出当天，春香和未来在正式演出前\n拍摄视频。明明不是大家都在的公演，\n观众却坐得满满当当，未来为此感到惊讶。\n制作人则激励她们，这次要用作为偶像的\n魅力，去抓住粉丝们的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d90d353cc99cea178736f7cfd03976cb228a192712d85fee347e3086932a5595", "ja": "（今日は『はるみら』としての公演。\nそろそろ本番だけど、春香と未来は……）", "zh": "（今天是『はるみら』的公演。差不多要正式开始了，春香和未来她们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "1fb07aa1c295048acbcbbaee9b481b3d4267bcbd4b66b0d7ee5e27e1b8949bcb", "ja": "と、いうわけでこれから本番です！\n緊張してないうちに撮りました、えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，接下来就要正式上台啦！\n趁着还没紧张起来先拍的，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "087893c4a0673e72bbd80301c7d235f1073dc6de298e2be789c2d11e799dabee", "ja": "緊張は波があるもんね～。\n今日は応援、よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "紧张也是会一阵一阵的嘛～。今天也请大家为我们加油啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7005ab53ef768424a3032cbf41c5e94985d31c13db3a431ce03d53f4b7f6d22c", "ja": "ふたりとも、なにしてるんだ？\nスマホでなにか録画してたみたいだけど……。", "zh": "你们两个在做什么呢？\n刚才好像在用手机录什么视频……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef240972b565f9c71f6feebc9acab9c0dc65075be722fec163f13002db84d522", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\n今、春香さんと一緒に短い動画を撮ってたんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n我刚才正在和春香一起拍短视频！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "9471a9797fd5545282e428b1e0ac6b887a372afcbae8bc7ac3c6ccbfe017a80e", "ja": "本番前の様子を撮ったショート動画です！\n内容、チェックしてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "这是拍摄正式演出前情景的短视频！\n可以请您帮忙检查一下内容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1faf6d2dcfab8b0b7461ab23b38db1f04497496f0ca74f1cc0658113f21d2ff1", "ja": "……うん、かわいく撮れてるじゃないか。\nアップしても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "……嗯，拍得很可爱嘛。\n上传也没问题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "6f0b4c224e0943811ac5cfc8d3097de0bd9680cd126c5f5c62480f7d8bfc297d", "ja": "やった♪　春香さん、\n加工どうしましょう？　キラキラにしますか！？", "zh": "太好了♪ 春香姐，要怎么修图呢？要不要弄得闪闪发光！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "23c566f316c597e9451592f9b364b4778712ce6e45c098cccc6cb2294b510502", "ja": "いいね♪　あっ、でも聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "好呀♪　啊，不过我听说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "6780b69514a030de2db64b641929949f0cb12735609ce9ba67c3a20c80dd9403", "ja": "あんまり加工しない方がリアルだし、\n本番前の緊張感が伝わることもあるんだって。", "zh": "不要过度加工反而显得更真实，\n而且据说有时也能把正式上场前的紧张感传达出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "0b434e8421d263cf1f026e73ea617e0a57d11405b380cef1f990fca067f11c1d", "ja": "そうなんだ……それじゃあ、\n今回はあえて、そのままでいきましょー！", "zh": "这样啊……那这次就故意保持原样吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ef0cd7c4723b5bd8aa8c58a91f02d12d4b34635e21aa8eac6c8e32927eff4c66", "ja": "春香も未来も、ふたりでミーティングしてから、\nすごく息が合ってる感じがするな。", "zh": "春香和未来，自从两个人开会之后，\n感觉配合得非常默契呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "18733b365c2f059456a2a1f84ee7643671eb80969431b09e16a5273389fc480e", "ja": "それはやっぱり、\nふたりでミーティングをしましたから！", "zh": "那当然是因为我们两个人一起开过会嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "b99db5fcd490d4d4849b7cf1dca3146291fb8671a0f6c09fdfbc59ea2867e787", "ja": "説明になってないような……。\nそのとおりだけど。ふふっ。", "zh": "好像也没解释清楚……不过确实是这样。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9df3d67e4f19355c1be8f07476769dff31ff9dded874bb582cce082aa649fff0", "ja": "ふたりで色んな番組に出ながら、\n新曲のレッスンも頑張ってたしな。", "zh": "我们一边参加各种节目，也一边努力练习新歌来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "4b32d83905bf5412b83604a3646c46d292fdcd170c291ed85c4022e8b0f698b9", "ja": "はい。おかげで、いろんなところで\n宣伝させてもらえて……お客さんもたくさんです！", "zh": "是的。多亏了这个机会，我们能在各种地方宣传……来了好多客人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "3055ca2be6654d4731caba2ad43f8c20c5ad221899ccfb10dde69f7c5bf1ba81", "ja": "本当に、いっぱいです！　今日は劇場の\nみんなじゃなく、私たちしか出ない公演なのに……。", "zh": "真的，好多人啊！明明今天不是剧场全员出演，而是只有我们参加的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "7a1d4d7f0835537c3e35cc5ed7c17529acfb0e2d32adf4092c827a137f4f3cfc", "ja": "うん。みんな、私と未来ちゃんを\n観に来てくれたんだよ。", "zh": "嗯。大家都是为了看我和未来\n才赶过来的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "35af028ffe783a87a0d695263e1996c24829d652bfebbb899b4a9881874a62e9", "ja": "さあ、そろそろだ。先輩と後輩、ドジっ子と天然ボケ、\nそれも確かに、ふたりの魅力ではあるけど……。", "zh": "好了，差不多到时候了。前辈和后辈、冒失鬼和天然呆，这些确实也是两人的魅力所在，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bdf1afb8c6866f8e63bde686a3830fd07426fbcae592962133acf60ab1bcdab5", "ja": "『はるみら』の魅力は、それだけじゃない。\n次はアイドルとしてのふたりで、大勢の心を掴むぞ！", "zh": "“春未来”的魅力，可不仅限于此。\n接下来就作为偶像，用你们两人的魅力去俘获更多人的心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "bdff5e88589ed95920c1711d551732588bd75564d2393eddecc7e6a23416ca01", "ja": "みなさん、今日は来てくれてありがとうございます！\n早速ですけど、私たち新曲をもらっちゃいました！", "zh": "大家，今天谢谢你们能来！\n我们马上就拿到了一首新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "ff5e9362d5ddc090127a420b5d7d9545a0192418bab32978535d72c1277f3d13", "ja": "す～っごく素敵な曲です！\n聞いてください！", "zh": "这是首超级棒的歌！\n请听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0257_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_06_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "6f868719adffe770878af0f8a02780352aebfc232e69a61b45fbee19070e3ba7", "ja": "せーの……っ！", "zh": "预备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
